## 🗺️ Cheat Sheet: Which Teammate Do I Use?

| If you want to... | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Ask questions about a set of files for one project | 📒 **Notebooks** |
| Get a multi-step job done (documents, decks, emails) | 🤝 **Cowork** |
| Make Cowork do a recurring task *your* way every time | 🧠 **Skills** |
| Run something automatically on a schedule | 🤝 Cowork **Automations** |

