## 🛠️ Troubleshooting

| Problem | Try this |
| --- | --- |
| I can't see **Notebooks** | Check the app launcher. You need a Copilot or Copilot Chat license. |
| I can't see **Cowork** | Your admin may need to enable it for your account. |
| Cowork is taking a long time | Multi-file tasks take several minutes. Watch the **Progress** log, or **Pause** and simplify the request. |
| My skill won't upload | The file must be named `SKILL.md`, with `name` and `description` at the top between `---` lines. The name must be lowercase with hyphens, for example `event-recap`. |
| My skill doesn't trigger | Make the `description` more specific and test in a **new** conversation. |
| The answer is wrong | Ask Copilot which source it used, then check that file yourself. |

